g","url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/","url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1","contentUrl":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/New-Lockups%402x.png?fit=214%2C64&ssl=1","width":214,"height":64,"caption":"Kraken Blog"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/logo\/image\/"}},{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/#\/schema\/person\/05fd1aef04d178f2231400ddb85550a2","name":"KrakenFX","image":{"@type":"ImageObject","inLanguage":"en-US","@id":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","url":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/16c47affada0c14e53e9e35216ec483ad12bcc35fd4cea0d6a2dd22cde9a6038?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/danielpintokraken"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-6sF","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/Blog-Banner-Wormhole.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24841","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089380"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=24841"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24841\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":24849,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/24841\/revisions\/24849"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/24843"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=24841"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=24841"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=24841"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=24841"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":24851,"date":"2024-04-03T12:14:53","date_gmt":"2024-04-03T16:14:53","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=24851"},"modified":"2024-04-26T08:47:42","modified_gmt":"2024-04-26T12:47:42","slug":"2024-futures-market-masters","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-derivatives\/2024-futures-market-masters","title":{"rendered":"Our $100,000 Futures Market Masters competition is back!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Update<\/strong>: That&#8217;s a wrap! Our biggest (and most lucrative) flagship futures trading competition* has ended. Want to see who won the whopping $100,000 USD prize pool? Click <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/futures-competition\">here<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-first-things-first\"><strong>First things first<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Before you jump in, there&#8217;s a small but important step: Make sure you&#8217;ve traded at least $2,500 in futures volume. It&#8217;s our way of ensuring everyone&#8217;s got the experience to make the most of the competition.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you\u2019ve already traded futures in Kraken Pro, you may have met this requirement already. Easily track your volume progress on the <a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/futures-competition\">competition page<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-so-what-s-it-all-about\"><strong>So, what\u2019s it all about?<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It&#8217;s all about showing off your futures trading skills and strategies. And winning prizes. The competition runs until April 26, 2024. So get registered and start trading today.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The top 10 traders by PnL% at the end of the competition will share the lucrative prize pool:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"683\" data-attachment-id=\"24874\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-derivatives\/2024-futures-market-masters\/attachment\/clipboard-5\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?fit=1046%2C698&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"1046,698\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"clipboard-5\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?fit=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?resize=1024%2C683&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-24874\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?resize=150%2C100&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/04\/clipboard-5.png?w=1046&amp;ssl=1 1046w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>An April 5, 2024 snapshot of the leaders in prize positions<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-register-and-get-10-on-us\"><strong>Register and get $10 on us<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Registering for Futures Market Masters 2024 gets you a $10 bonus** in your futures wallet after you meet the $2,500 trading volume requirement and register. This bonus is your trading collateral \u2013 it&#8217;s there to help you compete, but note that it can&#8217;t be withdrawn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-how-to-get-your-game-on\"><strong>How to get your game on:<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sign up on Kraken Pro if you haven&#8217;t already and get verified to <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360001395743-Verification-levels-explained?utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=2024_q1_pro_global_competition_3_rtn&amp;utm_content=link\">Intermediate or Pro<\/a>.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Make sure you&#8217;ve traded $2,500 in futures volume to unlock registration. That\u2019s the equivalent of opening five $500 trades.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sign up for the competition here and set your nickname \u2013 once entered we\u2019ll credit your bonus and you&#8217;re all set.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is your chance to demonstrate your skills against traders from around the world and claim a prize worth up to $40,000 \u2013 while market conditions could not be more exciting. Will you emerge as the next market master?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-for-the-newbies\"><strong>For the newbies<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Want to learn more about futures trading? Check out our Learn Center articles:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/en-gb\/learn\/trading\/why-trade-crypto-futures??utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=2024_q1_pro_global_competition_3_rtn&amp;utm_content=link\">Why do people trade crypto futures?<\/a><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/en-gb\/learn\/trading\/futures-trading?utm_source=braze&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=2024_q1_pro_global_competition_3_rtn&amp;utm_content=link\">What are crypto futures contracts?<\/a><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>*Geographic restrictions apply. Check if you\u2019re eligible <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/15478742641300-Futures-Trading-Competitions-Terms-Conditions\"><em>here<\/em><\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>**Futures collateral bonuses are for futures trading only and cannot be withdrawn. Idle bonus funds can be reclaimed by Kraken. You can add more personal funds during the competition.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>These materials are for general information purposes only and are not investment advice or a recommendation or solicitation to buy, sell, stake or hold any cryptoasset or to engage in any specific trading strategy. Kraken does not and will not work to increase or decrease the price of any particular cryptoasset it makes available. Some crypto products and markets are unregulated, and you may not be protected by government compensation and\/or regulatory protection schemes. The unpredictable nature of the cryptoasset markets can lead to loss of funds. Tax may be payable on any return and\/or on any increase in the value of your cryptoassets and you should seek independent advice on your taxation position. Geographic restrictions may apply.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p><i>Go head-to-head with thousands of traders and claim your share of $100,000.<\/i><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":24852,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1723,1793],"tags":[1403,1476],"language":[],"class_list":["post-24851","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kraken-derivatives","category-promotions","tag-kraken","tag-trading"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Our $100,000 Futures Market Masters competition is back! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/kraken-derivatives\/2024-futures-market-masters\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Our $100,000 Futures Market Masters competition is back!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\"